            "heading": "Set it and forget it",
            "body": "<p>Fill the reservoir, add a filter, scoop in your grounds, and hit brew. A few minutes later you've got anywhere from a single mug to a full twelve-cup carafe.</p><ul><li>Minimal hands-on time</li><li>Brews large batches at once</li><li>Simple, quick cleanup</li></ul>",
