            "body": "<p>Think about how much you drink and how you like it served:</p><ul><li><strong>Capacity</strong> — a 12-cup carafe for a busy household, or a compact size for smaller kitchens.</li><li><strong>Programmable timer</strong> — wake up to a pot that's already brewed.</li><li><strong>Thermal carafe</strong> — keeps coffee hot for hours without a hot plate scorching the flavor.</li></ul>",
